{"_id":"697d3e3f19b7a824528a4632","nodeId":"lWsJL135U-N5xIBnXqTYx","roadmapSlug":"ruby-on-rails","createdAt":"2026-01-30T23:26:55.240Z","description":"# Model Relationships\n\nModel relationships in Rails define how different models in your application are connected to each other. These relationships allow you to easily access related data and maintain data integrity. Common types of relationships include one-to-one, one-to-many, and many-to-many, each representing a different way that data entities can be associated.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Active Record Associations","url":"https://guides.rubyonrails.org/association_basics.html","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a235"},{"type":"article","title":"Active Record Associations","url":"https://www.theodinproject.com/lessons/ruby-on-rails-active-record-associations","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a236"},{"type":"article","title":"Active Record Associations For Dummies","url":"https://jontzavala.medium.com/active-record-associations-for-dummies-82af58050da4","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a237"},{"type":"article","title":"Ruby on Rails - Active Record Associations","url":"https://www.tutorialspoint.com/ruby-on-rails/rails-active-record-associations.htm","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a238"},{"type":"video","title":"Learn Active Record associations with Starwars","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E2jk4h1gQ2I","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a239"},{"type":"video","title":"Understanding Active Record Associations","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5mhuNSkV_vQ","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a23a"}],"updatedAt":"2026-01-30T23:26:55.240Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/ruby-on-rails/content/lWsJL135U-N5xIBnXqTYx.md"}